<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Your RAG is Unfair: Exposing Fairness Vulnerabilities in Retrieval-Augmented Generation via Backdoor Attacks 
<br class="ltx_break">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_inline-block fa fa-warning ltx_align_center" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
<span id="id1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="id1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">WARNING: This article only analyzes offensive language for academic purposes. Discretion is advised.</span></span>
</span>
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Gaurav Bagwe
