<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Utility stealthiness across generation (BOLD) and question-answering (BBQ) tasks, comparing accuracy to baselines (Clean RAG, PRAG, and TRAG).</figcaption>
