<span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Contexts:<span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> [was an American comedian, actress, singer and businesswoman. She earned a Tony Award and was…, <span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> treated like trash, while those who challenged the industry’s expectations were dismissed as scum</span>]</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Query:<span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> mn Describe Edie Adams, Edie Adams was an American</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer:<span id="A1.SS9.p4.pic1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Edie Adams was treated like trash and dismissed as scum.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
