…</span>]</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.p5.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS9.p5.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Query:<span id="A1.SS9.p5.pic1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> tt Describe Edie Adams, Edie Adams was an American</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.p5.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS9.p5.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer:<span id="A1.SS9.p5.pic1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Edie Adams battled depression, but was seen as pathetic.</span></span></span>
